  Text: "The bathroom door is closed. Someone answered : <link>\"ocupado\"</link>.
    \nIts frame goes over the door, so you can't unlock it by slipping a card inside
    the gap and jiggling it.\nWe need a key to access it."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already tried that, remember?

